; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Deque.c	    95   \DESCRIPTION    Write access to the dynamic data of a deque. Precondition assures that a valid deque pointer is
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Deque.c	    96                   provided to this function.
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Deque.c	    97   \COUNTERMEASURE \M [CM_OS_DEQUE_DYN_M]
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Deque.c	    98  
